## Chapter preflight

- [ ] Confirm POV, tense, narrative access, and narrator temperature.
- [ ] Select scene modes and strength settings from chapter function.
- [ ] Identify one or two style risks specific to this chapter.
- [ ] Confirm no source audit or source text is loaded.

## Chapter postflight

- [ ] Always-on invariants remain intact.
- [ ] Scene modes vary by function without mechanical repetition.
- [ ] Dialogue voices remain character-specific.
- [ ] Style did not override canon, causality, POV, or clarity.
- [ ] No source identity, proper noun, distinctive phrasing, setting, or plot sequence leaked.

## Source-isolation declaration

The rules above are neutralized mechanisms for original fiction. Do not infer missing rules from an author name, book title, source text, audit profile, or model memory.
